---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="R&D Advisory — Latent Sig" description="Strategic AI advisory: tech stack selection, feasibility studies, ethics & governance.">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-grid-pattern">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-surface/40 via-surface/70 to-surface"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-max-width mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-24">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 max-w-4xl">
        <span class="text-primary font-label-md text-label-md font-bold tracking-widest uppercase">R&amp;D Advisory</span>
        <h1 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl-mobile md:text-headline-xl text-on-surface leading-tight">
          From Theory to <span class="text-primary italic">Production</span>: Strategic AI Advisory.
        </h1>
        <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl">
          Bridging the gap between cutting-edge academic research and the engineering realities of enterprise deployment. We advise on architecture, feasibility, and the governance frameworks that turn experimentation into durable competitive advantage.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-4">
          <a href="#frameworks" class="px-8 py-4 bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container font-label-md text-label-md font-bold rounded-lg hover:brightness-110 transition-all">Explore Frameworks</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="px-8 py-4 border border-outline-variant text-on-surface font-label-md text-label-md font-bold rounded-lg hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors">Schedule a Workshop</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Core Advisory Services -->
  <section id="frameworks" class="py-32 bg-surface">
    <div class="max-w-max-width mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop">
      <div class="flex flex-col mb-16 gap-4">
        <span class="text-primary font-label-md text-label-md font-bold tracking-widest uppercase">Core Services</span>
        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg text-on-surface">Where We Add Leverage</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-gutter">
        <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-4 bg-surface-container-low border border-outline-variant/30 rounded-2xl p-10 hover:border-primary transition-all">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-5xl mb-8">architecture</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-4">Tech Stack Selection</h3>
          <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6">Choose the right model families, vector stores, and inference paths for your workload — without lock-in.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-surface rounded text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm border border-outline-variant/20">Scalability</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-surface rounded text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm border border-outline-variant/20">Cost-efficiency</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-4 bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/30 rounded-2xl p-10 hover:border-secondary transition-all">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-5xl mb-8">query_stats</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-4">Feasibility Studies</h3>
          <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6">De-risk new initiatives with structured prototypes, data audits, and quantified success criteria before you commit headcount.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-surface rounded text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm border border-outline-variant/20">Risk Mitigation</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-surface rounded text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm border border-outline-variant/20">Data Audit</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-4 bg-surface-container-high border border-outline-variant/30 rounded-2xl p-10 hover:border-tertiary transition-all">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-5xl mb-8">policy</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-4">Ethics &amp; Governance</h3>
          <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6">Establish review processes, eval harnesses, and policy alignment so the systems you ship are trustworthy and auditable.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-surface rounded text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm border border-outline-variant/20">Trust</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-surface rounded text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm border border-outline-variant/20">Compliance</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Research Leadership -->
  <section class="py-32 bg-surface-container-lowest">
    <div class="max-w-max-width mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop grid grid-cols-12 gap-gutter items-center">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-5 relative">
        <div class="w-full h-[500px] rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/20 bg-surface-container-low relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 dot-grid-bg"></div>
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/10 via-transparent to-secondary/10"></div>
          <div class="absolute inset-6 glass-panel rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col gap-3">
            <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant tracking-widest uppercase">LIVE BENCHMARK</span>
            <div class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary">94.7%</div>
            <div class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">model accuracy under adversarial eval</div>
            <div class="mt-4 h-2 bg-surface-container rounded overflow-hidden">
              <div class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-secondary" style="width: 94.7%"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7 flex flex-col gap-8">
        <span class="text-secondary font-label-md text-label-md font-bold tracking-widest uppercase">Research Leadership</span>
        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg text-on-surface">Methodology, not vibes.</h2>
        <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">
          Our advisors publish, benchmark, and stay in the loop. The frameworks we recommend are the ones we use in our own engineering work.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 border border-outline-variant/30 rounded-xl bg-surface-container">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mt-0.5">check_circle</span>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Algorithmic Optimization</h4>
              <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Quantization, distillation, and architectural pruning calibrated to your latency budget.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 border border-outline-variant/30 rounded-xl bg-surface-container">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mt-0.5">check_circle</span>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Proprietary Benchmarking</h4>
              <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Custom eval sets that reflect your real distribution — not whatever the leaderboard rewards.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Workshop CTA -->
  <section class="py-32 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-primary-container/10"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto px-margin-mobile text-center flex flex-col items-center gap-10">
      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg text-on-surface">Deep-Dive Technical Workshop</h2>
      <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">
        A focused engagement with our research leads to pressure-test your roadmap and surface the next 12 months of architectural decisions.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="px-10 py-5 bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-md text-label-md font-bold rounded-lg hover:brightness-110 shadow-lg shadow-primary/20 transition-all">
        Schedule a Workshop
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
